+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- A turn that runs tool rounds reports the sum of `inputTokens`, `outputTokens` and `totalTokens` across every provider call in that turn ([validated by: reports the sum of three provider calls when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L55)).
