+- A round that reports no usage does not make the total `undefined` or `NaN`: the rounds that reported are still summed, and a turn where no round reported usage reports `undefined` ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when one round reports none, and reports nothing when no round did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L65)).
